WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.043 --> 00:00:04.171
Good morning everyone, flight
time today is six hours,

00:00:04.213 --> 00:00:08.675
fifty four mintues and we wish
you a safe and pleasant flight.

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:12.012
Everybody down. 

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:17.142
Highjack is about a plane that
leaves from Dubai to London,

00:00:17.184 --> 00:00:18.685
the planes being hiijacked.

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:20.687
Stay in your seats.

00:00:20.896 --> 00:00:22.314
And it's not clear why.

00:00:23.232 --> 00:00:24.858
[Stuart] Operation has
commenced.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:25.859
I play Sam Nelson.

00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:29.363
Sam is an ordinary man in an
extrordinary situation.

00:00:29.363 --> 00:00:31.323
He's a very successful
business negotiator.

00:00:31.365 --> 00:00:32.991
And he's driven to
get back home.

00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:34.534
I just want to get home
to my family.

00:00:35.369 --> 00:00:38.830
I wanted to shoot this show as
close to being in a real

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:40.874
hijack situation as possible.

00:00:42.376 --> 00:00:44.586
We've brought in a real plane.

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:47.381
It had to feel like you were
really there with the passangers

00:00:47.381 --> 00:00:50.259
and that you were really
experincing that moment.

00:00:51.093 --> 00:00:53.845
Bam! Until you know who these
people are do nothing.

00:00:54.388 --> 00:00:58.141
We had the shell of a cockpit
connected to a flight simulator.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:00.102
All of the computer displays

00:01:00.102 --> 00:01:02.771
in the flight deck are as
realistic as possible.

00:01:03.105 --> 00:01:05.816
The integration of the volume
screen is one of the cutting

00:01:05.816 --> 00:01:09.403
edge aspects of our industry at
the moment. It helps create

00:01:09.403 --> 00:01:11.905
a level of authenticity
for the audience.

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:16.451
The lights move past the windows
at the same speed and angle

00:01:16.451 --> 00:01:18.745
as the sun really passes the
windows of plane

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:20.247
flying from Dubai.

00:01:20.622 --> 00:01:23.292
We've paid attention 
to every last detail.

00:01:23.417 --> 00:01:25.669
There's a ticking clock to tell
a real time thriller

00:01:25.669 --> 00:01:28.630
over seven hours on the plane
heading twords London.

00:01:28.839 --> 00:01:32.467
Each episode is a play by play
of what happens on the plane.

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:35.304
We are second by second, minute
by minute, hours by hours,

00:01:35.304 --> 00:01:36.305
edge of your seat.

00:01:36.555 --> 00:01:37.389
[Passanger] Get the gun.

00:01:37.514 --> 00:01:38.515
Don't make them do this.

00:01:39.266 --> 00:01:41.601
There's more and more tension,
twist and turns.

00:01:41.727 --> 00:01:43.186
It's a hell of a
rollercoaster ride.

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:46.064
Intense adrenaline, you are a
passanger on that plane.

00:01:46.231 --> 00:01:48.817
Sit down in your seat and buckle
up your seatbelt.

